        <blockquote>=E2=80=9CThere will likely be a whole host of architect=
ural challenges for which many enterprises are not yet prepared.=E2=80=9D</=
blockquote>

    </div>
</div>

   =20


				=09
				=09
						<div class=3D"cmp-di-pull-quote-content__attribution">
							=E2=80=94Mekena McGrew, quantum information lead, Deloitte Consultin=
g LLP
						</div>
